# Evaluating State Funding for Gifted Education Programs.

**Authors:** Baker, Bruce D., McIntire, Jay

## Abstract
This article provides an overview of state finance polices for gifted education and frameworks for evaluating those policies. The frameworks are then applied for evaluating state school finance policies as of 1998-99 and state aid allocated in 2002. Only Florida provided both sufficient and equitable support for gifted education. (Contains references.) (Author/CR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ673067

